  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Next\n\nFirst release. Everything a code rule author needs; a rule pack references only this package.\n\n- Rule interfaces: `ICodeRule` (parsed C# code), `ISolutionRule` (projects, csproj, packages, files) and `IRule<TContext>` for own analysis contexts that the engine builds once per run.\n- Every rule describes its convention with `Id`, `Title`, `Why` and `HowToFix`; optional `Tags`, `DefaultSeverity`, `DocumentationUrl`, `ReadMoreUrl`, `Skip`, `Deprecated` and `AllowSuppression`.\n- `Finding` with `What`, `Where`, `Current`/`ShouldBe` (shown as `-`/`+` lines), an optional `HowToFix` and `Severity` override and ordered `Details`.\n- `CodeContext` (production and test trees of the Solution Parser) and `SolutionContext`.\n- `ICodeRulePack` / `ICodeRuleRegistry`: a pack decides which of its rules a consumer gets.\n- Ships the descriptor source generator: compiled rule packs get the same generated tests (ID, title, tags) as rules in source.",
